# vdf-web

Read [docs/project-context.md](docs/project-context.md) and [docs/vdf-web-plan.md](docs/vdf-web-plan.md) before large changes.

- **VDF engine**: vendored under `engine/` (VDF.Core, VDF.CLI). This repo is the fork; do not pull upstream releases or download an official `vdf-cli`. AGPLv3. Invoke `vdf-cli scan` then `vdf-cli compare --format json`.
- **Two UI sections**: Files (local media, `.vdf-trash/`) and Immich (read-only library mount + API for stack/trash).
- **Runtime**: custom `server.ts` (not `next start`) for scheduler, single scan job, ffmpeg streaming.
- **Security**: `APP_PASSWORD` session, path jail on all file access, spawn CLI/ffmpeg with argv arrays, secrets only on data volume.
- **Deploy**: Docker Compose, port 47821, separate `--db` dirs per section.
- **Tests**: `npm test`, `verify-fixture`, `check-cli-help` must stay green when touching CLI parsing or Docker build.

Keep changes focused. Match existing conventions in `src/lib/` and shadcn components.
